The German pronunciations and glosses in this distribution are derived from
German Wiktionary (https://de.wiktionary.org), specifically from the
`dewiktionary-latest-pages-articles` XML dump published by the Wikimedia
Foundation.

Wiktionary text is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Attribution: the German Wiktionary contributors. Page histories, which name
them, are at https://de.wiktionary.org/wiki/<headword> under "Versionsgeschichte".

Share-alike: the derived data files in this distribution
(`src/denckring_de_wiktionary/data/`) are offered under the same CC BY-SA 4.0
licence. The code in this distribution is Apache-2.0 and is not a derivative of
the data.

This is why the data lives here and not in denckring-de-data, whose Wikidata
Lexemes are CC0 and impose neither condition. Merging the two would apply the
stricter licence to data that never carried it. See ADR 0013 and ADR 0030.

Regenerate the vendored files with scripts/build_pronunciations.py.
